  "conclusions": [
    "Scale-space E023c recovers materially more than standalone E023b followed by E024 on both captures.",
    "E024 remains useful on a weaker standalone baseline, but most of its raw C2 certificate gain is fountain-inert right-edge recovery.",
    "After E023c has combined complementary scale evidence, broad E024 refine has sharply diminishing return: zero C3 gain and one useful C2 gain at substantial work.",
    "The safe architecture is an immutable E023c certificate union plus independent per-lane E024 overlays; never feed one E024 overlay into another lane.",
    "The next bounded recovery mechanism should target piecewise/seam-aware pose or support extension rather than simply broadening global affine feedback, BP, or context search."
  ]
